{"Missing key check causes crash for older integrations - code directly accesses integration.metadata[\"sender\"][\"login\"] without verifying that sender exists in the metadata, causing KeyError and 500 error for integrations created before this change or through paths that didn't include sender information": 0.9832732677459717, "Unhandled exception from GitHub API call - get_user_info() function calls raise_for_status() internally which raises an exception if GitHub API returns an error status code, but the call has no try/except wrapper so network failures, GitHub outages, rate limiting, or invalid tokens cause unhandled exception and 500 error": 0.9677855372428894, "Network errors during token exchange cause unhandled crash - safe_urlopen() call is positioned outside the try/except block, so if GitHub's token endpoint is unreachable or has SSL issues, SSLError or ConnectionError propagates as unhandled exception causing 500 error": 0.9790157079696655}